[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10622.07, "timestamp": "02:57:02", "text": "我看到一隻小貓，兩隻小貓，三隻，我想"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10625.19, "timestamp": "02:57:05", "text": "是三隻"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10651.83, "timestamp": "02:57:31", "text": "，對吧？這是阿什，我把阿什叫做灰褐色。  所以，是的，他很可能是透過蚊子進入房子的。  蚊子，呃，就是你在窗戶上放的那種蚊子驅避器，對吧？那個網狀的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10656.87, "timestamp": "02:57:36", "text": "東西。貼紙網狀物。是的。他不知怎麼的把"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10662.95, "timestamp": "02:57:42", "text": "它移開了，不知怎麼的爬了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10665.03, "timestamp": "02:57:45", "text": "進去，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10668.87, "timestamp": "02:57:48", "text": "然後進了我的房間。我知道他會"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 10670.505, "timestamp": "02:57:50", "author": "@aniketwande4403", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_m_Z2M4vVHkWPdw0fzo-i-Dy4Pm4-b-bs22Utnn5zkWBHY=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "give her food and water okay"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10678.309, "timestamp": "02:57:58", "text": "睡在我靠窗的那一側，因為那裡很涼爽舒適，很適合睡覺。他喜歡睡在"}]